  - m_Id: 335601013350402
    m_Localized: Sentinel Oath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350403
    m_Localized: Projects a square oath mark, granting barrier and guarded to the
      ally under pressure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350404
    m_Localized: Linebreaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350405
    m_Localized: Shield-bashes the exposed enemy and applies sunder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350406
    m_Localized: Square Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350407
    m_Localized: Raises a short-lived lattice wall around the front line, adding
      barrier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350408
    m_Localized: Intercept Angle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350409
    m_Localized: Marks a protected ally and biases the sentinel to intercept incoming
      pressure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350410
    m_Localized: Oath Weight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350411
    m_Localized: Passive. Take reduced damage for 8 seconds after battle starts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350412
    m_Localized: Lattice Bastion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350413
    m_Localized: Passive. Whenever an ally falls, surviving allies gain a 25 barrier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350414
    m_Localized: Line Anchor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350415
    m_Localized: Support modifier; guard effects also steady nearby allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350416
    m_Localized: Iron Pelt Maul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350417
    m_Localized: Heavy close strike that wounds the nearest enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350418
    m_Localized: Rusthide Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350419
    m_Localized: Charges the exposed enemy and briefly roots them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350420
    m_Localized: Iron Pelt Roar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350421
    m_Localized: Emits a short pressure roar that exposes nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350422
    m_Localized: Iron-Hide Memory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350423
    m_Localized: Passive. The first time health falls below half, gain a 45 barrier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350424
    m_Localized: Last Pelt Standing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350425
    m_Localized: Passive; low health briefly grants unstoppable once per combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350426
    m_Localized: Prism Lance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350427
    m_Localized: Fires a thin prism bolt that prefers marked targets and refreshes
      mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350428
    m_Localized: Ember Arrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350429
    m_Localized: Shoots a fast ember-tipped arrow that applies burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350430
    m_Localized: Cinder Overrun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350431
    m_Localized: Pressures a weakened enemy with a cinder shot and slows them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350432
    m_Localized: Refracting Snare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350433
    m_Localized: Places a prism snare that roots an exposed target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350434
    m_Localized: Signal Flare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350435
    m_Localized: Marks a priority target and briefly exposes it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350436
    m_Localized: Ash Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350437
    m_Localized: Creates a short ash path and grants brief unstoppable repositioning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350438
    m_Localized: Prism Sight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350439
    m_Localized: Passive. Your active skills can critically strike and reach farther.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350440
    m_Localized: Heat Haze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350441
    m_Localized: Passive. The first time health falls below 60%, take reduced damage
      for 4 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350442
    m_Localized: Quick Kindling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350443
    m_Localized: Passive. Start each battle with 15 energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350444
    m_Localized: Glass Pathfinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350445
    m_Localized: Passive. When an ally falls, all enemies are marked for 3 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350446
    m_Localized: Shardblade Sever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350447
    m_Localized: A precise shard cut that wounds and sunders an exposed target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350448
    m_Localized: Mirror Cut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350449
    m_Localized: Throws a mirror-thin shard at a marked target and exposes them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350450
    m_Localized: Fracture Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350451
    m_Localized: Leaves a fractured lane that slows enemies trying to follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350452
    m_Localized: Riposte Angle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350453
    m_Localized: Sets a narrow counter angle and briefly gains guarded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350454
    m_Localized: Shard Memory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350455
    m_Localized: Passive. On kill, remaining enemies are exposed for 2.5 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350456
    m_Localized: Edge of Sentence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350457
    m_Localized: Passive. On kill, gain 20 energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350458
    m_Localized: Bloodless Form
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350459
    m_Localized: Passive. On kill, take reduced damage for 2.5 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350460
    m_Localized: Echo Resonance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350461
    m_Localized: Sends a focused resonance pulse that silences a marked target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350462
    m_Localized: Memory Tuning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350463
    m_Localized: Tunes an injured ally's memory pattern, healing and adding a light
      barrier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350464
    m_Localized: Phase Tether
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350465
    m_Localized: Tethers an exposed enemy in phase noise, rooting and slowing them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350466
    m_Localized: Echo Archive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350467
    m_Localized: Passive. Status effects from your active skills last 30% longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350468
    m_Localized: Lattice Listener
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350469
    m_Localized: Passive. At battle start, all enemies are slowed for 3 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350470
    m_Localized: Last Word
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350471
    m_Localized: Passive; once per combat, a collapsing ally can emit a brief silence
      pulse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350472
    m_Localized: Resonance Cleanse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335601013350473
    m_Localized: Support modifier; cleanse effects also grant a short unstoppable
      pulse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
